/* 色板/字号/圆角来自 docs/智能液位仪-小程序.psd 的解析结果，见发布的《液位仪视觉规范》。
   画板设计宽度 750px = 小程序 750rpx 基准，PSD 里量出的像素值可以直接当 rpx 数值用。 */

page {
  background-color: #edf0f7;
  color: #131313;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.container {
  padding: 24rpx;
}

/* 整屏居中容器：用于登录页、"扫码绑定设备"这类没有列表内容、
   只有一组表单/按钮的页面，避免内容顶在屏幕最上方。 */
.center-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 48rpx 48rpx 120rpx;
}

/* 品牌标志：直接用公司 LOGO 切图（docs/公司LOGO(7)），不是 CSS 画的方块 */
.brand-logo {
  width: 96rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}

.brand-title {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #131313;
  margin-bottom: 8rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.brand-subtitle {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #8697a4;
  margin-bottom: 48rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.center-card {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.card {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid #ededed;
  box-shadow: 0 2rpx 12rpx rgba(20, 32, 43, 0.05);
}

.row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.muted {
  color: #606060;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

.empty {
  text-align: center;
  color: #8697a4;
  padding: 80rpx 0;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.text-danger {
  color: #b23b3b;
}

.text-warning {
  color: #9c6b00;
}

.banner-danger {
  background-color: #fbe7e7;
  border: 1rpx solid #f3b4b4;
}

.banner-warning {
  background-color: #fff3d6;
  border: 1rpx solid #f0d48a;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background-color: #05507c;
  color: #ffffff;
  padding: 4rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

button.btn-primary {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #05507c, #0066a2);
  color: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 2.6;
}

button.btn-primary::after {
  border: none;
}

button.btn-secondary {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  color: #b23b3b;
  border: 1rpx solid #e1e1e1;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 2.6;
}

button.btn-secondary::after {
  border: none;
}

.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 6rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.badge-online {
  background-color: #e4f5ec;
  color: #1e7a4c;
}

.badge-offline {
  background-color: #ededed;
  color: #606060;
}

.badge-pending {
  background-color: #e4f1fb;
  color: #0066a2;
}

.badge-failed {
  background-color: #fbe7e7;
  color: #b23b3b;
}

.tabs {
  display: flex;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #ededed;
}

.tab-item {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20rpx 0;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #606060;
}

.tab-item-active {
  color: #05507c;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-bottom: 4rpx solid #05507c;
}

.field {
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.field-label {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #606060;
  margin-bottom: 8rpx;
  display: block;
}

.field-input {
  background-color: #f7f8fa;
  border: 1rpx solid #e1e1e1;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #131313;
}

/* 列表行：图标 + 文本 + 右侧箭头，对应设计稿里"设置/我的记录"弹层的菜单行样式 */
.list-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 28rpx 8rpx;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #ededed;
}

.list-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.list-row-icon {
  width: 64rpx;
  height: 64rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background-color: #e4f1fb;
  color: #05507c;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* 无底色的图标行，用于「设置/我的记录」菜单——设计稿里这些图标是直接放在白底上的，没有色块背景 */
.list-row-icon-plain {
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.list-row-body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.list-row-chevron {
  width: 28rpx;
  height: 28rpx;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* 选中态勾选标记：PSD 里"油站选择"没有导出专门的勾选图层，就是个状态符号，非插画 */
.text-selected-mark {
  color: #05507c;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* 罐体读数行：标签 + 加粗数值 + 单位，对应设计稿"液位 1666.8 毫米"的样式 */
.stat-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #606060;
  padding: 6rpx 0;
}

.stat-row-label {
  width: 96rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.stat-row-value {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #131313;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  margin-right: 8rpx;
}

.stat-row-unit {
  color: #8697a4;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.tabular-nums {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* 卧罐插画：从设计稿 PSD 里直接裁切导出（首页-卧罐01 画板），非 CSS 绘制 */
.tank-illustration {
  width: 112rpx;
  height: 148rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
}

.tank-card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.tank-card-body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* 设置项开关行：标签 + switch，用于"记录设置/报表设置"这类静态预览页 */
.switch-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 24rpx 8rpx;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #ededed;
}

.switch-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.section-title {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #606060;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 24rpx 0 12rpx;
}

.section-title:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}

button.btn-danger-mini {
  background-color: #fbe7e7;
  color: #b23b3b;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 2;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
}

button.btn-danger-mini::after {
  border: none;
}

/* 罐体形状选择卡片：对应设计稿"罐表设置"的卧罐/立罐/长方体选择 */
.shape-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.shape-card {
  background-color: #f7f8fa;
  border: 2rpx solid transparent;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 32rpx 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #606060;
}

.shape-card-active {
  border-color: #05507c;
  color: #05507c;
  font-weight: 600;
  background-color: #e4f1fb;
}

.shape-glyph {
  width: 72rpx;
  height: 72rpx;
  display: block;
  margin: 0 auto 12rpx;
}

/* 菜单列表：「我的记录」「设置」。数值取自设计稿「首页-我的记录04」「首页-设置05」PNG 的像素实测
   （设计稿里它们是半屏弹层，这里按"保留独立页面"处理，只对齐行内的尺寸与颜色）：
   行距约 118；图标 64×64 的 2x 切图按 32 显示，字形左缘 x=52；文字 x=101，28rpx #131313；
   箭头 32 显示，字形右缘距屏幕右 51；行与行之间没有分隔线。 */
.menu-list {
  background-color: #ffffff;
}

.menu-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  height: 118rpx;
  padding: 0 42rpx 0 50rpx;
}

.menu-icon {
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  margin-right: 19rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.menu-title {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #131313;
}

.menu-chevron {
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
